      "role": "user",
      "content": "helo. temporal sync is drifting. i'm seeing a massive causality anchor failure centered around the mid-east region for later this week.\n\ncan you cross-reference your real-time data streams with the 2140 divergence models? i need to know if this is a local anomaly or if the Great Pivot is actually fracturing. the stability of the 2025 timeline depends on this.",
